@startuml 19-web-data-flow
!include style.iuml
title Web data flow - session gate, then client fetches
autonumber
participant "Browser" as B
participant "Next.js server component" as N
participant "API" as A
B -> N : GET /tor/{projectId} (cookies)
N -> A : GET /api/auth/me\n(forward cookie, INTERNAL_API_URL)
alt no valid session
  A --> N : 401
  N --> B : redirect to /login
else signed in
  A --> N : user
  N --> B : HTML shell
  B -> A : GET /api/tors/{projectId}\n(credentials: include)
  A --> B : Procurement JSON
end
note over B, A
  The session cookie is httpOnly, so only the server can read it.
  lib/api.ts reports status 0 for a network failure
  and the HTTP status otherwise.
end note
@enduml
